# Datasets / Large media files (ignore heavy media while preserving subfolders and annotations)
*.parquet
dataset/text/**/*
dataset/images/**/*
dataset/screenshots/**/*
dataset/qr_codes/**/*
dataset/pdfs/**/*
dataset/processed/**/*
dataset/external/**/*
!dataset/**/
